<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="YPV9n" id="YPV9n" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u95226808" id="u95226808">🍀</span><span data-lake-id="u59b770b0" id="u59b770b0"> 𝐒𝐞𝐜𝐫𝐞𝐭𝐬 𝐨𝐟 𝐑𝐋𝐇𝐅 𝐢𝐧 𝐋𝐚𝐫𝐠𝐞 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬 𝐏𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝐈: 𝐏𝐏𝐎</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u8a8623b8" id="u8a8623b8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u95404224" id="u95404224">随着模型规模、数据规模和训练计算量的扩大，大语言模型涌现出小模型所不具备的显著特性，典型能力包括上下文学习、指令遵循和逐步推理。基于这些涌现能力，大语言模型甚至展现出在词语与感知之间建立联系、进而与现实世界交互的潜力，为通用人工智能的实现带来可能性，例如能够操纵工具的具身语言模型，以及交互式沙盒环境中的生成式智能体</span></strong></p><ul list="u48d975a0"><li fid="u62a305ed" data-lake-id="ub25ae388" id="ub25ae388"><span data-lake-id="ue541f25e" id="ue541f25e">尽管具备上述能力，但由于大语言模型的训练目标是捕捉预训练语料的数据特征，而这些语料同时包含高质量和低质量数据，模型可能表现出非预期行为，例如编造事实、生成带有偏见或毒性的文本，甚至生成对人类有害的内容。这就需要使大语言模型与人类价值观对齐，例如有用、诚实和无害</span></li><li fid="u62a305ed" data-lake-id="u037b3de6" id="u037b3de6"><span data-lake-id="u12bb429c" id="u12bb429c">为缓解潜在的重大危害风险，当前大多数工作尝试在 SFT 中加入一些 3H 数据，希望引导模型的回答在道德和伦理层面发生积极转变。然而，即使加入一组安全性和事实依据性目标，以刻画模型在对话中应当表现出的行为，模型在安全性和事实依据性方面的表现仍低于人类水平。</span></li><li fid="u62a305ed" data-lake-id="u3b6e6858" id="u3b6e6858"><span data-lake-id="uc11ba5cb" id="uc11ba5cb">因此，需要更加有效且高效的控制方法，以消除使用大语言模型的潜在风险。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2acfab6d" id="u2acfab6d" style="color: #70000D">OpenAI 和 Anthropic 已验证，RLHF 是使语言模型在广泛任务上与用户意图对齐的一条有效途径</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufeaa0c1a" id="ufeaa0c1a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u55306db6" id="u55306db6" style="color: #AD1A2B">训练与人类价值观对齐的大语言模型是一项艰巨任务，采用强化学习训练时往往会反复失败。一般而言，成功的 RLHF 训练需要准确的奖励模型来替代人类判断，需要仔细探索超参数以实现稳定的参数更新，还需要强有力的 PPO 算法来实现稳健的策略优化</span></strong></p><ul list="u30ff38c0"><li fid="u0d39c589" data-lake-id="u62b524b0" id="u62b524b0"><span data-lake-id="uc2e55bfc" id="uc2e55bfc">在数据质量较低、对齐目标难以明确定义的情况下，训练得到的奖励模型很容易误导 PPO 算法，使其朝难以理解的方向优化</span></li><li fid="u0d39c589" data-lake-id="ud36e655a" id="ud36e655a"><span data-lake-id="uef6b7a2a" id="uef6b7a2a">使用 PPO 微调语言模型需要协调四个模型共同工作，即</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua6de4dfa" id="ua6de4dfa" style="color: #AE146E">策略模型、价值模型、奖励模型和参考模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7ec6531a" id="u7ec6531a">，这使得训练及其向大参数规模模型的扩展变得困难</span></li><li fid="u0d39c589" data-lake-id="u8eed2d63" id="u8eed2d63"><span data-lake-id="uf74ca1a9" id="uf74ca1a9">在新的语言环境中，PPO 面临奖励稀疏和词空间探索效率低下的问题，因此对超参数较为敏感</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u62540d0d" id="u62540d0d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u95a53fe2" id="u95a53fe2">在本报告中，作者仔细剖析 RLHF 框架，并讨论决定算法训练能否成功的完整过程</span></strong></p><ul list="u1a6c6937"><li fid="ub73a7190" data-lake-id="u39395254" id="u39395254"><span data-lake-id="uec23a7f8" id="uec23a7f8">探索奖励模型的质量如何影响策略模型的最终表现，发现奖励模型的质量直接决定策略模型的性能上限</span></li><li fid="ub73a7190" data-lake-id="ud1373890" id="ud1373890"><strong><span data-lake-id="uabd20e10" id="uabd20e10" style="color: #664900">使用由策略模型得到的动作空间建模指标来监测 PPO 训练过程，例如困惑度、回答长度，以及策略模型与 SFT 模型之间的 KL 散度。与回答奖励值和损失函数值相比，这些指标更能反映训练的稳定性</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udbd18c53" id="udbd18c53" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790657145483-5428575c-fa7f-4841-b293-6d7311b2796e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u81976f7f-64fc-4df6-84f0-fc8193a6a0e%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u020e89a5-60cd-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A774%2C%22height%22%3A434%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A503388%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1443%2C%22originHeight%22%3A809%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22INFO%3ADICT%5BSTR%2CTORCH.TENSOR%5D%3DNONE%23%E9%A2%9D%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%2C%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95(%E5%A6%82TENSORBOARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A83%2C%22y%22%3A766%2C%22width%22%3A1121%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REWARDS%3ATORCH.TENSOR%3DNONE%23%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E4%BC%98%E5%8A%BF%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%96%E5%8A%B1(B%2CS)%22%2C%22x%22%3A78%2C%22y%22%3A676%2C%22width%22%3A811%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RES%3ATORCH.TENSOR%3DNONE%23%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E9%87%87%E6%A0%B7%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%96%E5%8A%B1%E5%88%86%E6%95%B0(B%2CS)%22%2C%22x%22%3A113%2C%22y%22%3A722%2C%22width%22%3A761%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BASE_ACTIONLOG_PROBS%3ATORCH.TENSOR%3DNONE%23%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%8A%A8%E4%BD%9C%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E6%95%B0%E6%A6%82%E7%8E%87(B%2CS)%22%2C%22x%22%3A81%2C%22y%22%3A365%2C%22width%22%3A1008%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ADVANTAGES%3ATORCH%2CTENSOR%3DNONE%23%E4%BC%98%E5%8A%BF%E5%80%BC(B%2CS)%22%2C%22x%22%3A80%2C%22y%22%3A496%2C%22width%22%3A696%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACTIONLOGPROBS%3ATORCH.TENSOR%3DNONE%23%E5%8A%A8%E4%BD%9C%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E6%95%B0%E6%A6%82%E7%8E%87(B%2CS)%22%2C%22x%22%3A79%2C%22y%22%3A317%2C%22width%22%3A894%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ATTENTIONMASK%3ATORCH%2CLONGTENSOR%3DNONE%23%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%E5%8A%9B%E6%8E%A9%E7%A0%81(B%2CS)%22%2C%22x%22%3A81%2C%22y%22%3A229%2C%22width%22%3A864%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KL%3ATORCH.TENSOR%3DNONE%23KL%E6%95%A3%E5%BA%A6(B%2CS)%22%2C%22x%22%3A77%2C%22y%22%3A543%2C%22width%22%3A595%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACTION_MASK%3ATORCH.BOOLTENSOR%3DNONE%23%E5%8A%A8%E4%BD%9C%E6%8E%A9%E7%A0%81(B%2CA)%22%2C%22x%22%3A81%2C%22y%22%3A278%2C%22width%22%3A801%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROMPTS%3ALIST%5BSTR%5D%3DNONE%23%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E8%AF%8D%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A78%2C%22y%22%3A587%2C%22width%22%3A563%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RETURNS%3ATORCH.TENSOR%3DNONE%23%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E5%80%BC(B%2CS)%22%2C%22x%22%3A80%2C%22y%22%3A454%2C%22width%22%3A655%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SEQUENCES%3ATORCH.TENSOR%3DNONE%23%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97(B%2CS)%22%2C%22x%22%3A83%2C%22y%22%3A185%2C%22width%22%3A712%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VALUES%3ATORCH.TENSOR%3DNONE%23%E4%BB%B7%E5%80%BC%E4%BC%B0%E8%AE%A1(B%2CS)%22%2C%22x%22%3A80%2C%22y%22%3A407%2C%22width%22%3A670%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INDEX%3A1IST%5BINT%5D%3DNONE%23%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E7%9A%84%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95%22%2C%22x%22%3A84%2C%22y%22%3A137%2C%22width%22%3A533%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22EXPERIENCE%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E4%BA%86%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8ERLHF%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A73%2C%22y%22%3A95%2C%22width%22%3A663%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221S%3A1IST%5BSTR%5D%3DNONE%23%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A137%2C%22y%22%3A634%2C%22width%22%3A464%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C1ASSEXPERIENCE%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A52%2C%22width%22%3A251%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%40DATAC1ASS%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A8%2C%22width%22%3A147%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f4ed%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u152415ba%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="RMHIJ" id="RMHIJ" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u5d535402" id="u5d535402">🐧</span><span data-lake-id="ue3208c9b" id="ue3208c9b"> 𝐑𝐞𝐢𝐧𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐜𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐋𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐟𝐫𝐨𝐦 𝐇𝐮𝐦𝐚𝐧 𝐅𝐞𝐞𝐝𝐛𝐚𝐜𝐤</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u16c40b8c" id="u16c40b8c"><strong><span data-lake-id="udeb57d0d" id="udeb57d0d">AI 助手的训练过程主要包括三个阶段：监督微调（SFT）、奖励模型（RM）训练，以及基于该奖励模型的近端策略优化</span></strong></p><ul list="u289bb0be"><li fid="u6ad9e6cf" data-lake-id="ubb9a07e8" id="ubb9a07e8"><span data-lake-id="u836df6f5" id="u836df6f5">在 SFT 阶段，模型通过模仿人工标注的对话示例，学习开展类似人类的通用对话</span></li><li fid="u6ad9e6cf" data-lake-id="ua0732f91" id="ua0732f91"><span data-lake-id="uf80fffa9" id="uf80fffa9">随后进行奖励模型训练，使模型能够根据人类反馈比较不同回答的偏好程度</span></li><li fid="u6ad9e6cf" data-lake-id="u1afa1746" id="u1afa1746"><span data-lake-id="u680bfba7" id="u680bfba7">在 PPO 阶段，根据奖励模型的反馈更新模型，力求通过探索与利用找到经过优化的策略。在 RLHF 过程中，作者主要关注奖励模型训练和通过 PPO 进行强化学习这两个阶段</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9aef3af9" id="u9aef3af9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790655214948-6b7e347e-6d97-45eb-b499-0dd8b5e2819e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub40e027f-6af1-4040-a793-d5e26b36540%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ufa3d2617-2d2f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A775.6000366210938%2C%22height%22%3A387%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A258928%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1257%2C%22originHeight%22%3A628%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22O%3DR(SCA)%2BYV(ST%2B-V%22%2C%22x%22%3A573%2C%22y%22%3A199%2C%22width%22%3A188%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ADVANTAGEFUNCTIO%22%2C%22x%22%3A581%2C%22y%22%3A112%2C%22width%22%3A149%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RT%3DA(ST%2CAT)%2BV(ST)%22%2C%22x%22%3A574%2C%22y%22%3A259%2C%22width%22%3A154%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A(STAT)%3DEOYNLOT%2BI%22%2C%22x%22%3A571%2C%22y%22%3A140%2C%22width%22%3A163%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EXNERIENCEBUIFER%22%2C%22x%22%3A607%2C%22y%22%3A550%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NEY(ACLSE)%22%2C%22x%22%3A59%2C%22y%22%3A441%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STATAST%2CAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A606%2C%22y%22%3A457%2C%22width%22%3A127%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%93%81AELS%E4%BC%9A%22%2C%22x%22%3A1024%2C%22y%22%3A76%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PRETRAININGDATA%22%2C%22x%22%3A877%2C%22y%22%3A332%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PPO-CLIPLOSS%22%2C%22x%22%3A1111%2C%22y%22%3A221%2C%22width%22%3A118%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TSFT(ATLST%22%2C%22x%22%3A68%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EIA(ATLST)%22%2C%22x%22%3A413%2C%22y%22%3A480%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AA(ATLST)R%22%2C%22x%22%3A616%2C%22y%22%3A492%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22XYIYZ%2C%2CY%22%2C%22x%22%3A153%2C%22y%22%3A357%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SEROUERY%22%2C%22x%22%3A121%2C%22y%22%3A595%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A(ST%2CAT)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1089%2C%22y%22%3A190%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POLICY%22%2C%22x%22%3A942%2C%22y%22%3A63%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VOCST)%22%2C%22x%22%3A965%2C%22y%22%3A512%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22G(AELSE)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1098%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22O(ST)%22%2C%22x%22%3A369%2C%22y%22%3A276%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A358%2C%22y%22%3A69%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MSELOSS%22%2C%22x%22%3A1154%2C%22y%22%3A522%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RBAI(AELSO)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1108%2C%22y%22%3A140%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R(ST%2CAT)%22%2C%22x%22%3A494%2C%22y%22%3A121%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A360%2C%22y%22%3A93%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LMLOSS%22%2C%22x%22%3A1163%2C%22y%22%3A310%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TDERROR%22%2C%22x%22%3A580%2C%22y%22%3A171%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A967%2C%22y%22%3A487%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VODE%22%2C%22x%22%3A175%2C%22y%22%3A94%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A367%2C%22y%22%3A251%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(ST%2CAT)%22%2C%22x%22%3A857%2C%22y%22%3A81%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POLIC%22%2C%22x%22%3A172%2C%22y%22%3A432%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IM%22%2C%22x%22%3A183%2C%22y%22%3A458%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B9%BFDIVIDE%22%2C%22x%22%3A192%2C%22y%22%3A315%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VALUE%22%2C%22x%22%3A965%2C%22y%22%3A456%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BM(AELST)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1121%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VALUE%22%2C%22x%22%3A367%2C%22y%22%3A221%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%227(X%2CY)%22%2C%22x%22%3A362%2C%22y%22%3A123%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VGST)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1086%2C%22y%22%3A497%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(SEA)%22%2C%22x%22%3A191%2C%22y%22%3A266%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RETURN%22%2C%22x%22%3A574%2C%22y%22%3A230%2C%22width%22%3A136%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A119%2C%22y%22%3A538%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A46%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%228%25%22%2C%22x%22%3A181%2C%22y%22%3A487%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(ST%2CAT)%22%2C%22x%22%3A141%2C%22y%22%3A179%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A(ST%2CAT)%22%2C%22x%22%3A593%2C%22y%22%3A346%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%83L%22%2C%22x%22%3A951%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VST)%22%2C%22x%22%3A459%2C%22y%22%3A235%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(X.Y)%22%2C%22x%22%3A94%2C%22y%22%3A357%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GAE%22%2C%22x%22%3A647%2C%22y%22%3A75%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(ST%2CAT)%22%2C%22x%22%3A416%2C%22y%22%3A448%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LM%22%2C%22x%22%3A950%2C%22y%22%3A93%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X9)%22%2C%22x%22%3A307%2C%22y%22%3A80%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SFT%22%2C%22x%22%3A176%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SPT%22%2C%22x%22%3A178%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A876%2C%22y%22%3A274%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A46%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AI%22%2C%22x%22%3A35%2C%22y%22%3A97%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RT%22%2C%22x%22%3A686%2C%22y%22%3A346%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R(X.Y%22%2C%22x%22%3A430%2C%22y%22%3A78%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f1f0ef%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u8d9fa9f5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua216cdb6" id="ua216cdb6"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud1dd6929" id="ud1dd6929">在奖励模型的架构方面，作者采用基于 Transformer 的预训练语言模型，移除最后的反嵌入层，并在最后一个 Transformer 层后增加一个线性层。对于任意给定文本，奖励模型会为最后一个 token 分配一个标量奖励值，奖励值越大，表示样本越好。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf8dbe24f" id="uf8dbe24f">遵循 Stiennon 等人的方法，奖励模型通常使用成对比较数据集进行训练，其中每个样本对由针对同一输入生成的两个回答构成。对于每一对偏好样本与非偏好样本，其建模损失为</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc2508453" id="uc2508453" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Cpsi)%20%3D%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cleft(r(x%2Cy_w)-r(x%2Cy_l)%5C%5Cright).%20%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d07cf852abc01c47d4bf62b0c9d21ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FvKm0%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u16ac211c"><li fid="u7f083e8b" data-lake-id="u6cb84b65" id="u6cb84b65"><span data-lake-id="u34572c1e" id="u34572c1e">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F788df1ba344b3092def7590d1be6b4d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uldpE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7573ac86" id="u7573ac86">为 sigmoid 函数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72cb3a229067770aeb6caa625a65a1a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EcLII%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9c8684d3" id="u9c8684d3">表示参数为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa4254e2c30b75094b9ccabd5bda217a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22exLCQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0adf7ed8" id="u0adf7ed8">的奖励模型，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x%2Cy)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa30cc997964d97530c45dfbf5e0cc2c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r7mLc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5a90dbf6" id="u5a90dbf6">是针对输入提示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ycFOb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6552a981" id="u6552a981">和回答</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf98c0ddcbe9c1e535f767c78c3aa813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hto6Y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u50e0cfb6" id="u50e0cfb6">预测的标量奖励。在每个样本对的偏好回答上引入自回归语言模型损失，使模型能够模仿每个句子对中的偏好回答。在实际实现中，为语言模型损失加入系数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brm%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9806e7bd7c8c8967d59d5de3dad6961b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qHie0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4599b66f" id="u4599b66f">。最终，奖励建模损失定义如下</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u72532e9e" id="u72532e9e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Cpsi)%20%3D%20-%5C%5Clambda%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(x%2Cy_w%2Cy_l)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brm%7D%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Clog%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cleft(r(x%2Cy_w)-r(x%2Cy_l)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%2B%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brm%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(x%2Cy_w)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brm%7D%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cleft(r'(x%2Cy_w)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa1e6961e0e914f540a87d190703e673c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GwZDs%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u265dacb8"><li fid="u93eaa05e" data-lake-id="ubb3317a5" id="ubb3317a5"><span data-lake-id="uf7cda50f" id="uf7cda50f">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brm%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf41ac9d150df88c7757b06033477ed1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XlAkW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42c689ad" id="u42c689ad">为训练集的经验分布。除顶部线性层外，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r'%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa1c02d0910a5c7bac72f9575cea3beab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RZhMB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufbf745ab" id="ufbf745ab">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72cb3a229067770aeb6caa625a65a1a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fMPdm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u23085445" id="u23085445">的模型结构相同；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r'%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa1c02d0910a5c7bac72f9575cea3beab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uMzes%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u15d312c0" id="u15d312c0">顶部线性层的维度对应词表大小，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r'(x%2Cy_w)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F07599dc7fee3acdec609d7f9dda92392.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zM8zd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u68b21f21" id="u68b21f21">表示给定提示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22awReM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0e9e002c" id="u0e9e002c">和偏好回答</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22d3748a1a6b1a91dda986e0b204471a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NNobZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0e938cc1" id="u0e938cc1">时的似然</span></li><li fid="u93eaa05e" data-lake-id="u5927cedc" id="u5927cedc"><span data-lake-id="ub32067db" id="ub32067db">作者在奖励函数中加入一个额外项，根据学习得到的强化学习策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BRL%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F114e7d458d29e984441b4748715a5605.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tTtm7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue3bf1dc0" id="ue3bf1dc0">与初始监督模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSFT%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff8892020394e96d0c50028325e85d329.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ASNmh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uecf52e08" id="uecf52e08">之间的 Kullback–Leibler（KL）散度施加惩罚</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7a13da6f" id="u7a13da6f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btotal%7D%7D%20%3D%20r(x%2Cy)-%5C%5Ceta%5C%5Coperatorname%7BKL%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BRL%7D%7D(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%2C%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSFT%7D%7D(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%5C%5Cright).%20%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F04b363e09675931efedd8843329c9402.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QjpIE%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1477df57"><li fid="u5d5ae373" data-lake-id="uf8d00766" id="uf8d00766"><span data-lake-id="u255daf9f" id="u255daf9f">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ceta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7483c6745bb07f292eba02b3a9b55c26.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GQJYe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u05d95fdc" id="u05d95fdc">为 KL 奖励系数，用于控制 KL 惩罚的强度。该 KL 散度项在此情境下发挥两个重要作用。首先，它作为熵奖励项，促进策略空间中的探索，防止策略过早收敛至单一模式。其次，它确保强化学习策略的输出不会大幅偏离奖励模型在训练阶段接触过的样本</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5860aba5" id="u5860aba5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u87c3ca79" id="u87c3ca79" style="color: #101E60">由于状态—动作空间庞大，将强化学习应用于对话生成面临重大挑战。在每个时间步，智能体从环境中接收状态</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe24a254996c6d6d65ed16befdaac934d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wqJa8%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u44b8c9ab" id="u44b8c9ab" style="color: #101E60">，即对话历史，其中包含截至当前由助手和人类产生的全部对话文本。随后，智能体根据策略</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26d01865f6e830adaa66117e307e316f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bymwY%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud2374714" id="ud2374714" style="color: #101E60">执行动作</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc61a8b387e1cb6c40608f4ae65d6f6a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ufLEq%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6ac86328" id="u6ac86328" style="color: #101E60">，即生成下一个 token。环境返回奖励</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(s_t%2Ca_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5ab122400b0a5f5c41026c675f9902ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22baIz0%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2b711a2c" id="u2b711a2c" style="color: #101E60">，该奖励由基于人类偏好数据训练得到的奖励函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72cb3a229067770aeb6caa625a65a1a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22j8fwj%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf3dd23ed" id="uf3dd23ed" style="color: #101E60">计算。随后，智能体转移至下一状态</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bt%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F776dbac38978dc7298a7cae99bbd8516.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OovpI%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud91e8f2c" id="ud91e8f2c" style="color: #101E60">，其中包含更新后的对话历史</span></strong></p><ul list="uc0f36e76"><li fid="u85bd6c59" data-lake-id="u3b01d726" id="u3b01d726"><span data-lake-id="uca7c64c3" id="uca7c64c3">强化学习的目标是为智能体找到最优行为策略，使轨迹</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctau%3D%5C%5C%7Bs_1%2Ca_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cs_T%2Ca_T%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffe4f1b37bbc18fd2084c21074e4ceafe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gP5Yh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d316cfe" id="u7d316cfe">上的累积奖励，即回报，达到最大。一种回报形式是有限时域无折扣回报</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R(%5C%5Ctau)%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7Dr(s_t%2Ca_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5dfec16bd6817e9cecd3387560a87f1a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uyLlz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2c8b241f" id="u2c8b241f">，即固定步数内累积奖励的总和</span></li><li fid="u85bd6c59" data-lake-id="u3a69d12b" id="u3a69d12b"><span data-lake-id="u5f4e9be6" id="u5f4e9be6">另一种形式是无限时域折扣回报</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R(%5C%5Ctau)%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D0%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cinfty%7D%5C%5Cgamma%5Et%20r(s_t%2Ca_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb05a3d6898287d404c3cdce2a22a152c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GpLe3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u99693ef7" id="u99693ef7">，它以折扣因子</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F311b68103dbb4d527370af290dd0d91e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q5xtG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u360a2332" id="u360a2332">考虑智能体在整个轨迹中获得的所有奖励。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufbdc8a4c" id="ufbdc8a4c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u77b68dbb" id="u77b68dbb" style="color: #5C0036">策略梯度方法是一类直接优化智能体策略，即从状态到动作的映射的强化学习技术，而不像基于价值的方法那样学习价值函数。策略梯度方法的核心思想是使用梯度上升算法改进策略。从本质上说，这些方法沿着能够最大程度提高期望回报的方向调整策略参数</span></strong></p><ul list="u02f21b9b"><li fid="u775fe306" data-lake-id="u542f65c4" id="u542f65c4"><span data-lake-id="u2bd92dff" id="u2bd92dff">策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26d01865f6e830adaa66117e307e316f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Bt9IQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u12772170" id="u12772170">通常由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gom4Z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u39d1bd63" id="u39d1bd63">参数化，记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi(a%5C%5Cmid%20s%2C%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbb439bea9668b2d54a671800e0d388ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k3uGq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u897584dd" id="u897584dd">，表示在状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22V8e9O%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7bc38dcc" id="u7bc38dcc">下采取动作</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26fdbf8e53cb0e48da5f4ddd4aaf5a5c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wPeag%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u956fea0a" id="u956fea0a">的概率。策略梯度的更新规则为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u31bf58c9" id="u31bf58c9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cleftarrow%20%5C%5Ctheta%2B%5C%5Calpha%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7DJ(%5C%5Ctheta).%20%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38ff51985e7ee4be277bb179b3fd3ab4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x4nIc%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u8cf76843"><li fid="u3fbb4e0a" data-lake-id="u09711da2" id="u09711da2"><span data-lake-id="u39f0dced" id="u39f0dced">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18d25ca4f77a9bbed9812e2bb0b350a5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ejMWG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue33d697a" id="ue33d697a">为学习率，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22J(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fca2bfb8e73d65f76f8e20c82a070c0e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IqR8D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2a21551c" id="u2a21551c">表示遵循策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e9808ff98b9bc6839ec21cbba8fe05b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N0eyp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9aaa678a" id="u9aaa678a">时的期望回报，策略性能的梯度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7DJ(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F69398f213abb043db62fe0f80a6ad9be.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sQsMe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0ab8d3df" id="u0ab8d3df"> 称为策略梯度。策略梯度的一般形式可表示为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8488dddc" id="u8488dddc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7DJ(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctau%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D0%7D%5E%7BT%7D%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(a_t%5C%5Cmid%20s_t)%5C%5CPhi_t%5C%5Cright%5D.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde13e77c111eb7a9e0b002483241e0dd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xu9S7%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u36a63a58"><li fid="u32a60a0d" data-lake-id="ue06d2762" id="ue06d2762"><span data-lake-id="ubef0e754" id="ubef0e754">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPhi_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F212d2f473ab5a2a1d1d5efc36fd92023.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ks8wA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1590d149" id="u1590d149">可以取</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPhi_t%3DR(%5C%5Ctau)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5a038fcc4bb472a693745d5dd033601d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HwEBq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2a619dcc" id="u2a619dcc">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPhi_t%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt'%3Dt%7D%5E%7BT%7DR(s_%7Bt'%7D%2Ca_%7Bt'%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9ec4b88ea6cd7da43f395ae463ed0f7d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y3kZ0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4a7f6ed9" id="u4a7f6ed9">，或带有基线</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd29c2e5f4926e5b0e9a95305650f6e54.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CoR2X%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4b77c2da" id="u4b77c2da">的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPhi_t%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt'%3Dt%7D%5E%7BT%7DR(s_%7Bt'%7D%2Ca_%7Bt'%7D)-b(s_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb381b31dfb9550d538ba4c71701a75d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22B4Shc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udb75de3e" id="udb75de3e">。尽管这些选择具有不同的方差，但它们得到的策略梯度期望值相同。回报通过蒙特卡洛采样计算。这种方法的优势在于其无偏性，因为它仅依赖实际获得的回报，而不对回报进行估计</span></li><li fid="u32a60a0d" data-lake-id="uf54684de" id="uf54684de"><span data-lake-id="u887c9406" id="u887c9406">然而，该方法的高方差也带来挑战。这种方差源于环境的随机性，例如一个回合内发生的随机事件，以及策略本身的随机性，使得不同轨迹可能产生不同的回报。为降低这种方差，一种常见策略是在策略梯度更新规则中，使用优势函数估计代替原始回报。优势函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22A(s_t%2Ca_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdb4d98561dabd882b6c48a7e5c2b8bf2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oAJa4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u066a03aa" id="u066a03aa">表示，在状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe24a254996c6d6d65ed16befdaac934d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22F7NOU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueb483ae2" id="ueb483ae2">下采取特定动作</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc61a8b387e1cb6c40608f4ae65d6f6a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tmAGW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0ccb7156" id="u0ccb7156">，相对于同一策略下该状态中动作的平均质量，能够带来多大程度的改善。因此</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uefb2c383" id="uefb2c383" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPhi_t%20%3D%20A(s_t%2Ca_t).%20%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F626871f44a54ef984016df4d7e85117c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22apHBI%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua10a136c"><li fid="uf59d3581" data-lake-id="u01da9202" id="u01da9202"><span data-lake-id="u3eee1f7a" id="u3eee1f7a">从数学上看，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22A(s_t%2Ca_t)%3DQ(s_t%2Ca_t)-V(s_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1935d7e22325d77b9aa5ccce2ae60b88.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pnXy6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0a608191" id="u0a608191">，其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q(s_t%2Ca_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3315e5e52c9463051080389e2323b573.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DxQDl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5a17df04" id="u5a17df04">为动作价值函数，表示在状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ve4rx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4a097da1" id="u4a097da1">下采取动作</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc61a8b387e1cb6c40608f4ae65d6f6a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MPifB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uac5cac8c" id="uac5cac8c">后的期望回报；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V(s_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5d330876260b9503fdc6820fce34bf5a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BWtpD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2d0f99b7" id="u2d0f99b7">为价值函数，表示状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe24a254996c6d6d65ed16befdaac934d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S14p8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6e5c1ea2" id="u6e5c1ea2">下的平均期望回报。将优势函数与策略梯度结合，是强化学习领域的重要基础</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7002adac" id="u7002adac" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790656088915-e46dfaf0-faa9-42a3-9eda-86b47afe14e0.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uef48f6bd-5ceb-47f3-b141-e6f7592b1ea%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8a416ae8-d7e4-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A941%2C%22height%22%3A411%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A658271%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1592%2C%22originHeight%22%3A696%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22PO(PROXIMALPOLICYOPTIMIZATION)%3AREINFORCELEARNINC%22%2C%22x%22%3A61%2C%22y%22%3A203%2C%22width%22%3A512%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A654%2C%22width%22%3A826%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3DMIM(RA%2CCLIP(R%2C1-6%2C1%E5%8D%81E)A)!%22%2C%22x%22%3A1227%2C%22y%22%3A589%2C%22width%22%3A330%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REWARDCALCULATION(SHAREDACROSSWORKERS)I%22%2C%22x%22%3A344%2C%22y%22%3A631%2C%22width%22%3A452%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RADIENTMIXING)%3APREVENTFORGETTIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A214%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A329%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A1360%2C%22y%22%3A142%2C%22width%22%3A188%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LELPPO%E5%8D%81LVALUE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1127%2C%22y%22%3A644%2C%22width%22%3A304%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PTX(PRETRAININGGRADIENT%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A256%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLINGFROMENVIRONME%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A271%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YELOG(%E5%85%83())%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A743%2C%22y%22%3A122%2C%22width%22%3A161%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-L4MODELS%3AACTORCRITIC.RMSFTL%22%2C%22x%22%3A763%2C%22y%22%3A647%2C%22width%22%3A402%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%228LOG(%E5%85%83(U1%E5%B7%A5)%2FNSET(U%7C)%22%2C%22x%22%3A559%2C%22y%22%3A548%2C%22width%22%3A199%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-CKCT%2CPREVENTFORGETTING%22%2C%22x%22%3A562%2C%22y%22%3A524%2C%22width%22%3A188%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EXPERIENCEBUFFE%22%2C%22x%22%3A839%2C%22y%22%3A245%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GITS(ACTION)%22%2C%22x%22%3A837%2C%22y%22%3A355%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EVALUATIONBYRM%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A630%2C%22width%22%3A243%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%AA(%2CG%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A51%2C%22y%22%3A601%2C%22width%22%3A112%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACTOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A399%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SFTMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A215%2C%22y%22%3A530%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22--%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80---------%E4%B8%80-%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A1186%2C%22y%22%3A615%2C%22width%22%3A262%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALUEFUNCTIOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A617%2C%22y%22%3A442%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22V(S)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1404%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LLAMA-7B%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A496%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.LETPTX%22%2C%22x%22%3A1337%2C%22y%22%3A640%2C%22width%22%3A212%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Q%2BREWARDR%22%2C%22x%22%3A564%2C%22y%22%3A595%2C%22width%22%3A189%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INSTRUCTIONS%22%2C%22x%22%3A186%2C%22y%22%3A324%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OGITS(ACTION)%22%2C%22x%22%3A998%2C%22y%22%3A557%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAMA-7B%22%2C%22x%22%3A1264%2C%22y%22%3A279%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OATI-13B%22%2C%22x%22%3A1009%2C%22y%22%3A458%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STRUCTIOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A57%2C%22y%22%3A392%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COATI-13B%22%2C%22x%22%3A345%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COATI-13%22%2C%22x%22%3A1039%2C%22y%22%3A68%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STAGE2-%22%2C%22x%22%3A920%2C%22y%22%3A132%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EEDEDFLOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A1260%2C%22y%22%3A132%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ESPONSE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1262%2C%22y%22%3A70%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RESPONSE)%22%2C%22x%22%3A187%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DATASET%22%2C%22x%22%3A57%2C%22y%22%3A411%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ADVANCEA%22%2C%22x%22%3A1319%2C%22y%22%3A489%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ATEVALU%22%2C%22x%22%3A845%2C%22y%22%3A324%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOGITS(SFT)%22%2C%22x%22%3A392%2C%22y%22%3A555%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GITS(ACTIO%22%2C%22x%22%3A451%2C%22y%22%3A442%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OATI-13B%22%2C%22x%22%3A372%2C%22y%22%3A297%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(INSTRUCTION%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A184%2C%22y%22%3A135%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WORKERS%22%